<title>USA: Pinkerton to acquire German security firm.</title>
<headline>Pinkerton to acquire German security firm.</headline>
<dateline>ENCINO, Calif. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pinkerton's Inc said on Friday it signed an agreement to acquire for cash  WKD Security GmbH, a provider of security services with headquarters in Germany.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the acquisition will be completed on January 1, 1997, subject to certain conditions.</p>
<p>Revenues of WKD Security in 1995 were approximately $23 million at current exchange rates. Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
